can no longer block his tax returns from a

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:15.190
subpoena in a grand jury in New York and will
have to turn them over.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:19.310
This is part of the investigation into Donald
Trump's business practices, and it's all falling

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:20.310
apart for him.

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:25.169
This was a three zero decision in the 2nd
U.S. Circuit Court of Appeals.

00:00:25.169 --> 00:00:28.300
The decision is Trump must turn over his tax
returns.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.300
Great.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.300
Right.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.610
So now the prosecution gets the tax returns,
